  "$schema": "../../🧬️schema/🔣️document-archive-load-host/🔣️.json",
  "law": "A host loads a whole document only through the stepped archive load: it admits once, polls until a terminal status, and acknowledges that terminal. A cancel before admission sends nothing; after admission it is sent once and polling goes on until the guest says whether it restored the previous document (cancelled) or the load won the race (ready). A cancelled terminal whose acknowledgement is refused is polled again. A load the guest admitted itself under the host's command sequence (a media import of a whole document of the app's own schema) is driven the same way from its first poll. A refused admission, poll or acknowledgement of a ready or faulted load is the guest's own fault, and a frame that answers another command is no answer.",
